# Pixi Canvas

- Document → Pixi is one-way sync from store; pointer tools write via Commands
- Map `node.id` → `DisplayObject` in a registry; destroy on delete
- Selection handles can be React overlay or Pixi layer; keep hit-testing in Pixi
- Use `NineSliceSprite` when `nineSlice` is set; else `Sprite`
- Design frame is a clipped root sized to `document.designSize`
- Pan/zoom the viewport camera; do not bake zoom into node transforms
